49: Class `Nette\Database\ISupplementalDriver` is replaced by `Nette\Database\Driver`.
51: Method `Nette\Database\IStructure::getBelongsToReference()` is deprecated: call it with the table only; it returns all belongsTo references of the table as an array of the referenced tables indexed by column, since nette/database 3.2.7.
53: Method `Nette\Database\IStructure::getHasManyReference()` is deprecated: call it with the table only; it returns all hasMany references of the table as an array of the referencing columns indexed by table, since nette/database 3.2.7.
